    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d438">

                <pb facs="d437-1" n="1" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/d437-1"/>

                <head>438. Telegram 1353 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d438-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-01-11">January 11, 1956, 2
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d438-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d438-1"/>
                <p>1353. From Johnson.</p>
                <p>Would appreciate prior to tomorrow’s meeting text any public reply that may have
                    been made by then to Peiping Allegation of US overflight Manchuria carried FBIS
                    item 1949 1/10 or any instructions on reply if Wang should raise subject.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
